## Contributing

By opening a pull request you agree that your contribution ships under the licence
covering the files you touched. See [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md).

## What this repo does not cover

kodi-drive links to, but does not copy, material from the Kodi wiki, the Kodi source, and
third-party projects. Those retain their own licences. In particular
[`xbmc/kodiai`](https://github.com/xbmc/kodiai) is proprietary and all rights are reserved
by its owner — nothing here is derived from it.
